  "scene_name": "Round Tower Study",
  "short_caption": "Round stone room with wooden furniture, upper shelf ledge, tiled floor",
  "literal_description": "A circular room with dark blue stone walls and a curved wooden ledge running around the walls at mid height, carrying crates, boxes and small ornaments. On the floor, furniture stands in a loose arc: a teal cabinet and dark red wooden desk with books on the left, a small orange chair, a central wooden table with a small green framed object and a jar, a purple cube pedestal with a table lamp, and wooden desks and chests on the right. The floor is square stone tiles in warm brown and ochre with patches of green grass and moss at the edges. A pool of warm light falls on the centre of the floor while the walls and ceiling stay in dark blue shadow. Bell-shaped lamps and round ornaments hang from the ceiling. The camera is at standing height, looking level towards a tall arched alcove in the back wall.",
